{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>青衣青華苑華豐閣有吊船工人被困。今日（4日）下午1時49分，警方接報兩名男工人乘吊船在華豐閣28樓外牆工作期間，吊船疑故障被困，據報二人沒有受傷。警察經初步調查相信是吊船機件故障，當時兩名工人正在外牆工作。其後消防員游繩將工人帶返安全位置。</p><p>現場所見，大廈梯間位置有圍網，據報吊船在圍網內，消防員協助工人脫困。</p><figure><img alt=\"大廈梯間位置有圍網，據報吊船在圍網內。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139216104233897984734105.jpeg/kNCtyXHpcjtTdodpYVNx3fDpGMYRfWPvHKzzATas8wE\"/><figcaption>大廈梯間位置有圍網，據報吊船在圍網內。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救護車在場候命。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139216101100621824830674.jpeg/DAmbPmmsG3wBlRd3k2RIdgcuqeaiZPyzLX7t8wd-7fM\"/><figcaption>救護車在場候命。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員正設法協助工人脫困。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139216098013483008286573.jpeg/kR_RVM0SlL5_0fSSY0cAki-qjnpRxuImpXBOeo9wTno\"/><figcaption>消防員正設法協助工人脫困。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救護員到場。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139246501919199232246750.jpeg/kLBjyBr040c6hK_HcV7CsAu3uFi4jkU2e0id2lFIndo\"/><figcaption>救護員到場。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救護員到場。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139246505111195648346529.jpeg/AX0QHoPDSBKE-djJYRJzSDEub3GDZbBjcJIH71qSB-8\"/><figcaption>救護員到場。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員到場游繩救回兩名工人。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139246508064116736639574.jpeg/FLy2WX36lorOjLHAAY1BiclbcckP-RT06EOHpMJDh6Q\"/><figcaption>消防員到場游繩救回兩名工人。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場有工人在外牆工作。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139246510790545408354760.jpeg/BD7OmyP5EPDa5DT1X9vROiBOjSh8TTx6Y6sKYkmrCmI\"/><figcaption>現場有工人在外牆工作。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-04T08:58:52.424137+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":281,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}